# edge LBN: NESTED lookbehind: (?<=ab) inside (?<=b..c), context three bytes back
# pcre2-only
pattern (?:(?<=b(?<=ab)c)d|\bw)
tag edge=LBN
ms 0 "abcd" 3 4
ms 1 "abcd" 3 4
ms 2 "abcd" 3 4
ms 3 "abcd" 3 4
ns 4 "abcd"
ns 0 "xbcd"
